Package: crowdblock-reporter
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Crowdblock Team <crowdblock@example.org>
Depends: adduser, systemd
Description: Crowdblock attack reporter
 Watches attack logs (auth.log, fail2ban.log) and reports attacking
 addresses to the crowdblock server. Configure plugins, thresholds and
 the server URL in /etc/crowdblock-reporter/config.yaml.
Homepage: https://github.com/adamchabin/crowdblock
